<title>UK: Coventry Bldng pretax profit rises 30.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Coventry Bldng pretax profit rises 30.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry Building Society, Britain's 12th largest, reported at pretax profit of 24.1 million stg for the year to December 1996.</p>
<p>Coventry said its gross mortgage lending rose 30.9 percent to 623 million stg.  </p>
<p>Coventry said its net advances improved 49.3 percent to 216 million stg. The group attracted 260 million stg in the retail savings sector.</p>
<p>Capital and reserves rose 16.4 million stg to 252 million. Coventry's gross capital ratio stood at 7.41 percent.</p>
<p>-London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
